    <CHAPTER cnumber="27">
      <VERS vnumber="1">Now the <gr str="1121">children </gr>of <gr str="3478">Israel </gr>after their <gr str="4557">number</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">that is</STYLE>, the <gr str="7218">chief </gr>
