      <VERS vnumber="22">Of <gr str="1835">Dan</gr>, <gr str="5832">Azareel </gr>the <gr str="1121">son </gr>of <gr str="3395">Jeroham</gr>. These <STYLE css="font-style:italic">were</STYLE> the <gr str="8269">princes </gr>of the <gr str="7626">tribes </gr>of <gr str="3478">Israel</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="23">But <gr str="1732">David </gr>
