        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="28">And over the olive <gr str="2132">trees </gr>and the sycamore <gr str="8256">trees </gr>that <STYLE css="font-style:italic">were</STYLE> in the low <gr str="8219">plains </gr>
